---
import Base from '../../../layouts/Base.astro';
---
<Base title="Property Management Advisory Ghana — Rent Policy &amp; Compliance | PRC" description="Hourly consultation for Ghanaian landlords on rent policy, tenant relations, maintenance, Act 220 compliance, and best practices.">
  <section class="section">
    <div class="wrap">
      <a href="/services/" style="color:#516784; text-decoration:none; margin-bottom:1rem; display:inline-block;">← Back to Services</a>

      <h1>Property Management Consultation</h1>
      <p class="muted" style="max-width:680px; margin-bottom:2rem;">Hourly consultation on rent policy, tenant relations, property maintenance schedules, compliance procedures, and operational best practices.</p>

      <div style="margin:2rem 0; padding:2rem; background:#f0f4f8; border-radius:8px;">
        <h2 style="margin-top:0;">Why You Need This Service</h2>
        <p style="line-height:1.8;">Property management has a lot of moving parts. You're not just charging rent — you're managing relationships, handling repairs, staying compliant, and staying profitable. Common questions:</p>
        <ul style="line-height:1.8; margin:1.5rem 0;">
          <li>What should my rent policy be across multiple properties?</li>
          <li>How do I handle difficult tenants professionally?</li>
          <li>What maintenance schedule should I follow?</li>
          <li>How do I stay compliant with Act 220?</li>
          <li>What's the best way to collect rent?</li>
          <li>How much should I charge for late payment?</li>
          <li>When should I replace vs. repair?</li>
        </ul>
        <p style="line-height:1.8;"><strong>This consultation answers these questions with practical, experience-based advice.</strong></p>
      </div>

      <div style="margin:2rem 0; padding:2rem; background:#f9f9f9; border-radius:8px;">
        <h2 style="margin-top:0;">Topics We Cover</h2>
        <ul style="line-height:1.8;">
          <li><strong>Rent Policy:</strong> How to set and adjust rent consistently</li>
          <li><strong>Tenant Relations:</strong> Professional communication and boundary-setting</li>
          <li><strong>Rent Collection:</strong> Best practices for on-time payment</li>
          <li><strong>Maintenance:</strong> Preventive schedule vs. emergency repairs</li>
          <li><strong>Compliance:</strong> Documentation and notification procedures</li>
          <li><strong>Problem Solving:</strong> Handling specific issues you're facing</li>
          <li><strong>Systems:</strong> How to organize your property management</li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <div style="margin:2rem 0; padding:2rem; background:#f9f9f9; border-radius:8px;">
        <h2 style="margin-top:0;">What You Get</h2>
        <ul style="line-height:1.8;">
          <li><strong>Expert Guidance:</strong> Practical advice based on experience</li>
          <li><strong>Customized Approach:</strong> Solutions tailored to your situation</li>
          <li><strong>Best Practices:</strong> How successful landlords operate</li>
          <li><strong>Templates & Tools:</strong> Sample policies, communication templates</li>
          <li><strong>Problem-Solving:</strong> Concrete solutions to your specific challenges</li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <div style="margin:2rem 0; padding:2rem; background:#fff3cd; border-radius:8px;">
        <h2 style="margin-top:0;">When You Need This Service</h2>
        <ul style="line-height:1.8;">
          <li>You're managing multiple properties and want consistency</li>
          <li>You're struggling with difficult tenants</li>
          <li>You want to improve your systems and procedures</li>
          <li>You're thinking about hiring a property manager and want to know what to expect</li>
          <li>You want professional advice on a specific management challenge</li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <div style="margin:2rem 0; padding:2rem; background:#e8f4f8; border-radius:8px;">
        <h2 style="margin-top:0;">Who Benefits Most</h2>
        <p style="line-height:1.8;">Landlords managing 3+ properties. If you have multiple units, investing in good management systems saves time and prevents disputes. A consultation often pays for itself in reduced conflict and smoother operations.</p>
      </div>

      <div style="margin:2rem 0; padding:2rem; background:#f9f9f9; border-radius:8px;">
        <h2 style="margin-top:0;">Pricing & Turnaround</h2>
        <p style="font-size:1.2rem; font-weight:700; color:#516784; margin:0;">GHS 250 per hour</p>
        <p style="color:#666; margin:0.5rem 0;">Sessions typically 1–2 hours</p>
        <p style="font-weight:600; margin-top:1rem;">Scheduling: By appointment (we work around your schedule)</p>
      </div>

      <div style="margin:3rem 0; text-align:center;">
        <a href="/services/" style="display:inline-block; padding:1rem 2rem; background:#516784; color:white; text-decoration:none; border-radius:4px; font-weight:600; margin-right:1rem;">Request a Quote</a>
        <a href="https://wa.me/233208071633" style="display:inline-block; padding:1rem 2rem; background:#f0f4f8; color:#516784; text-decoration:none; border-radius:4px; font-weight:600; border:1px solid #516784;">Chat on WhatsApp</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</Base>
